<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 760 1230" role="img"><title>손상 인식과 대표 수선 경로</title><defs><marker id="arrow" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" refX="7" refY="3.5" orient="auto"><path d="M0,0 L7,3.5 L0,7 Z" fill="#655381"/></marker><marker id="reverse" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" refX="0" refY="3.5" orient="auto"><path d="M7,0 L0,3.5 L7,7 Z" fill="#655381"/></marker><marker id="inhibition" markerWidth="3" markerHeight="12" refX="1.5" refY="6" orient="auto"><path d="M1.5,0 L1.5,12" stroke="#655381" stroke-width="1.5"/></marker></defs><g font-family="sans-serif"><path id="diagram.dna-repair-targets.e0" d="M350,124 L350,181" stroke="#655381" fill="none" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><rect x="318.755" y="121.8" width="62.49" height="24.7" fill="#fff"/><text x="350" y="140.5" font-size="18.7" text-anchor="middle" fill="#657482">대표 연결</text><path id="diagram.dna-repair-targets.e1" d="M350,414 L350,471" stroke="#655381" fill="none" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><rect x="318.755" y="411.8" width="62.49" height="24.7" fill="#fff"/><text x="350" y="430.5" font-size="18.7" text-anchor="middle" fill="#657482">대표 연결</text><path id="diagram.dna-repair-targets.e2" d="M350,704 L350,761" stroke="#655381" fill="none" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><rect x="318.755" y="701.8" width="62.49" height="24.7" fill="#fff"/><text x="350" y="720.5" font-size="18.7" text-anchor="middle" fill="#657482">대표 연결</text><path id="diagram.dna-repair-targets.e3" d="M350,994 L350,1051" stroke="#655381" fill="none" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/><rect x="288.461" y="991.8" width="123.078" height="24.7" fill="#fff"/><text x="350" y="1010.5" font-size="18.7" text-anchor="middle" fill="#657482">세포 상태·주형 고려</text><g id="n0"><rect x="105" y="36" width="490" height="88" rx="3" fill="#fff" stroke="#655381" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="350" y="87.7" font-size="22" text-anchor="middle" fill="#17212b">일부 손상 염기</text></g><g id="n1"><rect x="105